Z||000016||BENGAL4||01-31-2001||02:14 PM||||As a new bachelor, I am having to learn to cook all over again. I like throwing a turkey breast or a pork tenderloin on my Ronco Showtime Rotisserie. They cook in about 90 min. Great taste. I also make chili and veggie soup and eat on those for a few days.||||reg||10
